        "description": "Poor or paradoxical response to acetylcholinesterase inhibitors",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of typical clinical presentation plus electrophysiological abnormalities and confirmation by genetic testing",
    "notes": "Diagnosis requires exclusion of autoimmune myasthenia gravis and other CMS subtypes."
